<section class="section" id="s2" data-sec="2">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>2. try to + infinitive  vs  try + -ing</h2>

    <div class="note">
      <strong>📝 Mini explanation</strong>
      <p><strong>try to + infinitive</strong> = make an effort / attempt to do something (often difficult).<br>
      Example: <em>I’m trying to watch a movie in English.</em></p>
      <p><strong>try + -ing</strong> = experiment / do something to see what happens.<br>
      Example: <em>Try watching films with subtitles – it might help.</em></p>
      <p>Common mistake: “I’m trying watching…” → correct: “I’m trying <strong>to watch</strong>…”</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-panel" data-ex="2a">
      <div class="ex-header">
        <span class="ex-title">2A. Choose the correct form</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="score-2a">0/5</span>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button class="btn btn-check" data-ex="2a">Check</button>
          <button class="btn btn-show" data-ex="2a">Show answers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-clear" data-ex="2a">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label>1. Now I’m trying ___ a movie in English.</label>
        <select data-answer="to watch" data-sid="2a1">
          <option value="">–</option>
          <option value="to watch">to watch</option>
          <option value="watching">watching</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label>2. If you can’t sleep, try ___ a warm bath.</label>
        <select data-answer="taking" data-sid="2a2">
          <option value="">–</option>
          <option value="to take">to take</option>
          <option value="taking">taking</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label>3. She’s trying ___ more friendly with new people.</label>
        <select data-answer="to be" data-sid="2a3">
          <option value="">–</option>
          <option value="to be">to be</option>
          <option value="being">being</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label>4. Try ___ the gym early in the morning – the atmosphere is better.</label>
        <select data-answer="going to|going" data-sid="2a4">
          <option value="">–</option>
          <option value="to go to">to go to</option>
          <option value="going to">going to</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label>5. I’m trying ___ interesting films in English this month.</label>
        <select data-answer="to watch" data-sid="2a5">
          <option value="">–</option>
          <option value="to watch">to watch</option>
          <option value="watching">watching</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-panel" data-ex="2b">
      <div class="ex-header">
        <span class="ex-title">2B. Rewrite – correct the mistake</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="score-2b">0/3</span>
        <div class="btn-row">
