          <button class="btn btn-show" data-ex="2b">Show answers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-clear" data-ex="2b">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="instr">Rewrite the whole sentence correctly.</p>
      <p>1. Now I’m trying watching a movie in English.</p>
      <input type="text" class="sent" data-answer="Now I’m trying to watch a movie in English.|I’m trying to watch a movie in English.|Now I am trying to watch a movie in English." data-sid="2b1" placeholder="Rewrite the sentence…">
      <div class="ans-reveal" data-for="2b1">Now I’m trying to watch a movie in English.</div>

