<!-- ========== SECTION 3 ========== -->
<section class="section" id="s3" data-sec="3">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>3. influence / impact on</h2>

    <div class="note">
      <strong>📝 Mini explanation</strong>
      <p><strong>influence</strong> (verb) + <strong>on</strong> / <strong>impact</strong> (noun or verb) + <strong>on</strong></p>
      <p>Correct: <em>These factors can influence someone’s personality.</em><br>
      Correct: <em>Place where you live also has an impact on you.</em></p>
      <p>Common mistake: “influence on someone’s one’s personality” or missing “on”.</p>
      <p><strong>someone</strong> and <strong>one</strong> both mean “a person” – don’t write “someone’s one’s”.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-panel" data-ex="3a">
      <div class="ex-header">
        <span class="ex-title">3A. Gap-fill – prepositions & forms</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="score-3a">0/5</span>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button class="btn btn-check" data-ex="3a">Check</button>
          <button class="btn btn-show" data-ex="3a">Show answers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-clear" data-ex="3a">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>1. These factors can influence <input type="text" class="gap" data-answer="someone's|someone’s|a person's|one's" data-sid="3a1"> personality.</p>
      <p>2. The place where you live has a big impact <input type="text" class="gap" data-answer="on" data-sid="3a2"> you.</p>
      <p>3. Language can have a strong influence <input type="text" class="gap" data-answer="on" data-sid="3a3"> the way we think.</p>
      <p>4. Family gives you your first ideas about life and has an impact <input type="text" class="gap" data-answer="on" data-sid="3a4"> your character.</p>
      <p>5. Does the culture of the South have an influence <input type="text" class="gap" data-answer="on" data-sid="3a5"> how friendly people are?</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-panel" data-ex="3b">
      <div class="ex-header">
        <span class="ex-title">3B. Correct the sentence</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="score-3b">0/3</span>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button class="btn btn-check" data-ex="3b">Check</button>
          <button class="btn btn-show" data-ex="3b">Show answers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-clear" data-ex="3b">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>1. These factors can influence on someone’s one’s personality.</p>
      <input type="text" class="sent" data-answer="These factors can influence someone’s personality.|These factors can influence someone's personality.|These factors can influence a person's personality." data-sid="3b1" placeholder="Correct version…">
      <div class="ans-reveal" data-for="3b1">These factors can influence someone’s personality.</div>

      <p style="margin-top:12px">2. Place where you live also has impact on you.</p>
      <input type="text" class="sent" data-answer="The place where you live also has an impact on you.|Place where you live also has an impact on you." data-sid="3b2" placeholder="Correct version…">
      <div class="ans-reveal" data-for="3b2">The place where you live also has an impact on you.</div>

      <p style="margin-top:12px">3. Language forms our culture code on us by means of words.</p>
      <input type="text" class="sent" data-answer="Language forms our culture code by means of words.|Language forms our culture by means of words, phrases and idioms." data-sid="3b3" placeholder="Correct version…">
      <div class="ans-reveal" data-for="3b3">Language forms our culture code by means of words.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
