<!-- ========== SECTION 4 ========== -->
<section class="section" id="s4" data-sec="4">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>4. make vs do</h2>

    <div class="note">
      <strong>📝 Mini explanation</strong>
      <p><strong>make</strong> = create / produce / cause something to exist or happen.<br>
      <em>All these make us unique.</em> / <em>make a decision, make a mistake, make friends</em></p>
      <p><strong>do</strong> = perform an action / activity.<br>
      <em>do sport, do homework, do the shopping</em></p>
      <p>In the text: “All these <strong>make</strong> us unique” is correct.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-panel" data-ex="4a">
      <div class="ex-header">
        <span class="ex-title">4A. make or do?</span>
        <span class="score-pill" id="score-4a">0/6</span>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button class="btn btn-check" data-ex="4a">Check</button>
          <button class="btn btn-show" data-ex="4a">Show answers</button>
          <button class="btn btn-clear" data-ex="4a">Clear</button>
